ASoC: q6apm: track the FullIO pull producer state across DSP transactions

Advance START, SOFT_PAUSE, SOFT_RESUME and STOP only on their required proof. Keep uncertain owners out of re-arming and DMA reuse.
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c
@@ -381,8 +381,16 @@
